{"pair_id": "cc274a6c", "question": "Per l’anno di censimento più recente disponibile, elenca il nome di ciascun sottodistretto e la somma totale degli stabilimenti manifatturieri e di costruzione, includendo solo i sottodistretti in cui questa somma combinata è maggiore di zero, e ordina i risultati in base alla somma totale in ordine decrescente.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_MANUFACTURING + T2.EST_CONSTRUCTION) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_SECONDARY_SECTOR AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = (SELECT MAX(CENSUS_YEAR) FROM DIM_TIME) GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_MANUFACTURING + T2.EST_CONSTRUCTION) > 0.000 ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_MANUFACTURING + T2.EST_CONSTRUCTION) DESC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fss.est_manufacturing + fss.est_construction) AS total_manufacturing_construction\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_secondary_sector fss ON dl.location_id = fss.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fss.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = (SELECT MAX(census_year) FROM dim_time)\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nHAVING SUM(fss.est_manufacturing + fss.est_construction) > 0\nORDER BY total_manufacturing_construction DESC;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fss.est_manufacturing + fss.est_construction) AS total_manufacturing_construction\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_secondary_sector fss ON dl.location_id = fss.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fss.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = (SELECT MAX(census_year) FROM dim_time)\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nHAVING SUM(fss.est_manufacturing + fss.est_construction) > 0\nORDER BY total_manufacturing_construction DESC;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "936c601a", "question": "Per l'anno del censimento 2013, elenca il nome di ciascun sottodistretto insieme ai valori totali stimati della manifattura e delle costruzioni, raggruppati e ordinati alfabeticamente per nome del sottodistretto.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_MANUFACTURING), SUM(T2.EST_CONSTRUCTION) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_SECONDARY_SECTOR AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ASC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fss.est_manufacturing) AS total_manufacturing, SUM(fss.est_construction) AS total_construction\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_secondary_sector fss ON dl.location_id = fss.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fss.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fss.est_manufacturing) AS total_manufacturing, SUM(fss.est_construction) AS total_construction\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_secondary_sector fss ON dl.location_id = fss.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fss.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "34765acb", "question": "Per l’anno di censimento più recente disponibile, elenca il nome di ciascun sottodistretto e il valore manifatturiero totale stimato, ordinati dal valore manifatturiero totale stimato più alto al più basso.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_MANUFACTURING) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_SECONDARY_SECTOR AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = (SELECT MAX(CENSUS_YEAR) FROM DIM_TIME) GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_MANUFACTURING) DESC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fss.est_manufacturing) AS total_manufacturing_value\nFROM dim_time dt\nJOIN fact_secondary_sector fss ON dt.time_id = fss.time_id\nJOIN dim_location dl ON fss.location_id = dl.location_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = (SELECT MAX(census_year) FROM dim_time)\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_manufacturing_value DESC;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fss.est_manufacturing) AS total_manufacturing_value\nFROM dim_time dt\nJOIN fact_secondary_sector fss ON dt.time_id = fss.time_id\nJOIN dim_location dl ON fss.location_id = dl.location_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = (SELECT MAX(census_year) FROM dim_time)\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_manufacturing_value DESC;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "5acff517", "question": "Per l'anno del censimento 2013, elenca il nome di ciascun sottodistretto e il valore manifatturiero totale stimato, ordinati in base al valore manifatturiero totale stimato in ordine decrescente.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_MANUFACTURING) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_SECONDARY_SECTOR AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_MANUFACTURING) DESC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fss.est_manufacturing) AS total_manufacturing_value\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_secondary_sector fss ON dl.location_id = fss.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fss.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_manufacturing_value DESC;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fss.est_manufacturing) AS total_manufacturing_value\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_secondary_sector fss ON dl.location_id = fss.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fss.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_manufacturing_value DESC;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "cf374eef", "question": "Elenca i nomi dei sottodistretti per l'anno di censimento 2013 in cui il totale stimato della manifattura è maggiore di 0 e il totale stimato delle costruzioni è esattamente 0, raggruppati e ordinati alfabeticamente per nome del sottodistretto.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_SECONDARY_SECTOR AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_MANUFACTURING) > 0.000 AND SUM(T2.EST_CONSTRUCTION) = 0.000 ORDER BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ASC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_secondary_sector fss ON dl.location_id = fss.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fss.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND fss.est_manufacturing > 0\n  AND fss.est_construction = 0\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "raw_output": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_secondary_sector fss ON dl.location_id = fss.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fss.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND fss.est_manufacturing > 0\n  AND fss.est_construction = 0\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Mismatch (Order matters: True). Gold count: 3540. Pred count: 4355."}
{"pair_id": "09a75ff6", "question": "Per l'anno del censimento 2013, elenca il nome di ciascun sub-district insieme al valore totale stimato della manifattura e al valore totale stimato delle costruzioni, assicurandoti che il valore totale stimato della manifattura sia almeno 0.000, e ordina i risultati in base al valore totale stimato della manifattura in ordine decrescente.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_MANUFACTURING), SUM(T2.EST_CONSTRUCTION) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_SECONDARY_SECTOR AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_MANUFACTURING) >= 0.000 ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_MANUFACTURING) DESC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fss.est_manufacturing) AS total_manufacturing, SUM(fss.est_construction) AS total_construction\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_secondary_sector fss ON dl.location_id = fss.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fss.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nHAVING SUM(fss.est_manufacturing) >= 0.000\nORDER BY total_manufacturing DESC;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fss.est_manufacturing) AS total_manufacturing, SUM(fss.est_construction) AS total_construction\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_secondary_sector fss ON dl.location_id = fss.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fss.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nHAVING SUM(fss.est_manufacturing) >= 0.000\nORDER BY total_manufacturing DESC;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "6ad0ce72", "question": "Elenca i nomi dei sottodistretti per l'anno di censimento 2013 in cui il numero di stabilimenti manifatturieri è superiore a 500 oppure il numero di stabilimenti edili è superiore a 200, raggruppati per nome del sottodistretto.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_SECONDARY_SECTOR AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' AND (T2.EST_MANUFACTURING > 500 OR T2.EST_CONSTRUCTION > 200) GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME", "predicted_sql": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_secondary_sector fss ON dl.location_id = fss.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fss.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND (fss.est_manufacturing > 500 OR fss.est_construction > 200)\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "raw_output": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_secondary_sector fss ON dl.location_id = fss.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fss.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND (fss.est_manufacturing > 500 OR fss.est_construction > 200)\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "49d857a2", "question": "Elenca i nomi dei sottodistretti per l'anno di censimento '2013' in cui il totale stimato della produzione manifatturiera è superiore a 500 oppure il totale stimato delle costruzioni è superiore a 200, e ordina i risultati alfabeticamente per nome del sottodistretto.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_SECONDARY_SECTOR AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_MANUFACTURING) > 500 UNION SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_SECONDARY_SECTOR AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_CONSTRUCTION) > 200 ORDER BY SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ASC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_secondary_sector fss ON dl.location_id = fss.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fss.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND (fss.est_manufacturing > 500 OR fss.est_construction > 200)\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "raw_output": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_secondary_sector fss ON dl.location_id = fss.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fss.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND (fss.est_manufacturing > 500 OR fss.est_construction > 200)\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Mismatch (Order matters: True). Gold count: 64. Pred count: 41."}
{"pair_id": "ff9ec42b", "question": "Per l'anno del censimento 2013, elenca i nomi dei sub-district e i nomi dei village ULB/RLB in cui le spese totali stimate per alloggio e vitto sono almeno pari a 0.000, e ordina i risultati alfabeticamente per nome del sub-district.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_TRANSPORT_HOSPITALITY AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_ACCOMMODATION_FOOD) >= 0.000 ORDER BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ASC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_transport_hospitality fth ON dl.location_id = fth.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fth.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013 AND fth.est_accommodation_food >= 0.000\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_transport_hospitality fth ON dl.location_id = fth.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fth.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013 AND fth.est_accommodation_food >= 0.000\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Mismatch (Order matters: True). Gold count: 29896. Pred count: 29998."}
{"pair_id": "0fe8bc91", "question": "Per l'anno di censimento 2013, elenca il nome di ciascun sottodistretto insieme ai costi totali stimati di trasporto e magazzinaggio e ai costi totali stimati di alloggio e ristorazione, raggruppati e ordinati alfabeticamente per nome del sottodistretto.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_TRANSPORT_STORAGE), SUM(T2.EST_ACCOMMODATION_FOOD) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_TRANSPORT_HOSPITALITY AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ASC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT\n    dl.sub_district_name,\n    SUM(fth.est_transport_storage) AS total_transport_storage,\n    SUM(fth.est_accommodation_food) AS total_accommodation_food\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_transport_hospitality fth ON dl.location_id = fth.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fth.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "raw_output": "SELECT\n    dl.sub_district_name,\n    SUM(fth.est_transport_storage) AS total_transport_storage,\n    SUM(fth.est_accommodation_food) AS total_accommodation_food\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_transport_hospitality fth ON dl.location_id = fth.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fth.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "f5e1ad47", "question": "Per l’anno di censimento più recente disponibile, elenca i nomi dei sottodistretti insieme ai costi totali stimati di trasporto e magazzinaggio e ai costi totali stimati di alloggio e ristorazione, raggruppati per sottodistretto e ordinati in ordine decrescente in base ai costi totali stimati di trasporto e magazzinaggio.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_TRANSPORT_STORAGE), SUM(T2.EST_ACCOMMODATION_FOOD) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_TRANSPORT_HOSPITALITY AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = (SELECT MAX(CENSUS_YEAR) FROM DIM_TIME) GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_TRANSPORT_STORAGE) DESC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name,\n       SUM(fth.est_transport_storage) AS total_transport_storage,\n       SUM(fth.est_accommodation_food) AS total_accommodation_food\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_transport_hospitality fth ON dl.location_id = fth.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fth.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = (SELECT MAX(census_year) FROM dim_time)\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_transport_storage DESC;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name,\n       SUM(fth.est_transport_storage) AS total_transport_storage,\n       SUM(fth.est_accommodation_food) AS total_accommodation_food\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_transport_hospitality fth ON dl.location_id = fth.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fth.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = (SELECT MAX(census_year) FROM dim_time)\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_transport_storage DESC;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "e1ccb964", "question": "Per l'anno del censimento 2013, elenca il nome di ciascun sottodistretto e il totale stimato dei costi di alloggio e ristorazione, ordinati in base ai costi totali in ordine decrescente.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_ACCOMMODATION_FOOD) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_TRANSPORT_HOSPITALITY AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_ACCOMMODATION_FOOD) DESC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fth.est_accommodation_food) AS total_accommodation_food\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_transport_hospitality fth ON dl.location_id = fth.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fth.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_accommodation_food DESC;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fth.est_accommodation_food) AS total_accommodation_food\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_transport_hospitality fth ON dl.location_id = fth.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fth.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_accommodation_food DESC;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "e7fc6264", "question": "Per l'anno del censimento 2013, elenca i nomi dei sottodistretti e i costi totali stimati per alloggio e vitto dei 10 sottodistretti con i costi totali più elevati.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_ACCOMMODATION_FOOD) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_TRANSPORT_HOSPITALITY AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_ACCOMMODATION_FOOD) DESC LIMIT 10", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fth.est_accommodation_food) AS total_accommodation_food_cost\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_transport_hospitality fth ON dl.location_id = fth.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fth.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_accommodation_food_cost DESC\nLIMIT 10;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fth.est_accommodation_food) AS total_accommodation_food_cost\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_transport_hospitality fth ON dl.location_id = fth.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fth.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_accommodation_food_cost DESC\nLIMIT 10;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "a29de23a", "question": "Elenca i nomi dei sottodistretti in ordine alfabetico per l'anno del censimento 2013 in cui i valori stimati di trasporto e magazzinaggio e i valori stimati di alloggio e ristorazione sono entrambi maggiori di zero.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_TRANSPORT_HOSPITALITY AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' AND T2.EST_TRANSPORT_STORAGE > 0.000 AND T2.EST_ACCOMMODATION_FOOD > 0.000 GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ASC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_transport_hospitality fth ON dl.location_id = fth.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fth.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND fth.est_transport_storage > 0\n  AND fth.est_accommodation_food > 0\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "raw_output": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_transport_hospitality fth ON dl.location_id = fth.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fth.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND fth.est_transport_storage > 0\n  AND fth.est_accommodation_food > 0\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "579e0a14", "question": "Elenca i nomi dei sottodistretti dell'anno del censimento 2013 che avevano un valore totale stimato per trasporto e magazzinaggio maggiore di zero, escludendo però specificamente i sottodistretti che nello stesso anno hanno anche riportato un valore stimato per alloggio e ristorazione maggiore di zero, e ordina i risultati alfabeticamente per nome del sottodistretto.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_TRANSPORT_HOSPITALITY AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_TRANSPORT_STORAGE) > 0.000 AND T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME NOT IN (SELECT T4.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T4 JOIN FACT_TRANSPORT_HOSPITALITY AS T5 ON T4.LOCATION_ID = T5.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T6 ON T5.TIME_ID = T6.TIME_ID WHERE T6.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' AND T5.EST_ACCOMMODATION_FOOD > 0.000) ORDER BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ASC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_transport_hospitality fth ON dl.location_id = fth.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fth.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND fth.est_transport_storage > 0\n  AND NOT EXISTS (\n    SELECT 1\n    FROM fact_transport_hospitality fth2\n    JOIN dim_time dt2 ON fth2.time_id = dt2.time_id\n    WHERE fth2.location_id = dl.location_id\n      AND dt2.census_year = 2013\n      AND fth2.est_accommodation_food > 0\n  )\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "raw_output": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_transport_hospitality fth ON dl.location_id = fth.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fth.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND fth.est_transport_storage > 0\n  AND NOT EXISTS (\n    SELECT 1\n    FROM fact_transport_hospitality fth2\n    JOIN dim_time dt2 ON fth2.time_id = dt2.time_id\n    WHERE fth2.location_id = dl.location_id\n      AND dt2.census_year = 2013\n      AND fth2.est_accommodation_food > 0\n  )\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Mismatch (Order matters: True). Gold count: 533. Pred count: 1201."}
{"pair_id": "a7c2466f", "question": "Elenca i nomi degli ULB, degli RLB o dei villaggi in cui il valore stimato del trasporto e dello stoccaggio è superiore a 50 oppure il valore stimato dei servizi di alloggio e ristorazione è superiore a 50, ordinati alfabeticamente per nome del villaggio.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_TRANSPORT_HOSPITALITY AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID WHERE T2.EST_TRANSPORT_STORAGE > 50 OR T2.EST_ACCOMMODATION_FOOD > 50 ORDER BY T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME", "predicted_sql": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_transport_hospitality fth ON dl.location_id = fth.location_id\nWHERE fth.est_transport_storage > 50 OR fth.est_accommodation_food > 50\nORDER BY dl.ulb_rlb_village_name;", "raw_output": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_transport_hospitality fth ON dl.location_id = fth.location_id\nWHERE fth.est_transport_storage > 50 OR fth.est_accommodation_food > 50\nORDER BY dl.ulb_rlb_village_name;", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Mismatch (Order matters: True). Gold count: 45. Pred count: 44."}
{"pair_id": "5a214bd0", "question": "Elenca i nomi dei sottodistretti dell'anno 2013 in cui la somma stimata del trasporto e magazzinaggio è almeno pari a 0.000 e la somma stimata dell'alloggio e ristorazione è maggiore di 0.000, e ordina i risultati alfabeticamente per nome del sottodistretto.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_TRANSPORT_HOSPITALITY AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_TRANSPORT_STORAGE) >= 0.000 AND SUM(T2.EST_ACCOMMODATION_FOOD) > 0.000 ORDER BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ASC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_transport_hospitality fth ON dl.location_id = fth.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fth.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND fth.est_transport_storage >= 0.000\n  AND fth.est_accommodation_food > 0.000\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "raw_output": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_transport_hospitality fth ON dl.location_id = fth.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fth.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND fth.est_transport_storage >= 0.000\n  AND fth.est_accommodation_food > 0.000\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "57101395", "question": "Per l'anno del censimento 2013, elenca i nomi dei villaggi ULB RLB in cui il valore stimato della salute umana e dell'assistenza sociale è superiore a 50.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_EDUCATION_HEALTH AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' AND T2.EST_HUMAN_HEALTH_SOCIAL > 50", "predicted_sql": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_education_health feh ON dl.location_id = feh.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON feh.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013 AND feh.est_human_health_social > 50;", "raw_output": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_education_health feh ON dl.location_id = feh.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON feh.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013 AND feh.est_human_health_social > 50;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "e9093393", "question": "Per l'anno del censimento 2013, elenca i nomi degli ULB, RLB o dei villaggi che hanno un valore totale stimato per la salute umana e l'assistenza sociale superiore a 50 e ordina i risultati in base a questa somma in ordine decrescente.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_EDUCATION_HEALTH AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_HUMAN_HEALTH_SOCIAL) > 50 ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_HUMAN_HEALTH_SOCIAL) DESC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_education_health feh ON dl.location_id = feh.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON feh.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013 AND feh.est_human_health_social > 50\nORDER BY feh.est_human_health_social DESC;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_education_health feh ON dl.location_id = feh.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON feh.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013 AND feh.est_human_health_social > 50\nORDER BY feh.est_human_health_social DESC;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "4b45c0d6", "question": "Per l’anno di censimento più recente disponibile, elenca il nome di ciascun villaggio ULB RLB insieme alla somma totale delle strutture sanitarie e sociali, ordinati in base alla somma totale in ordine decrescente.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_HUMAN_HEALTH_SOCIAL) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 INNER JOIN FACT_EDUCATION_HEALTH AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID INNER JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = (SELECT MAX(CENSUS_YEAR) FROM DIM_TIME) GROUP BY T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_HUMAN_HEALTH_SOCIAL) DESC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT\n    dl.ulb_rlb_village_name,\n    SUM(feh.est_human_health_social) AS total_health_social_establishments\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_education_health feh ON dl.location_id = feh.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON feh.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = (SELECT MAX(census_year) FROM dim_time)\nGROUP BY dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nORDER BY total_health_social_establishments DESC;", "raw_output": "SELECT\n    dl.ulb_rlb_village_name,\n    SUM(feh.est_human_health_social) AS total_health_social_establishments\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_education_health feh ON dl.location_id = feh.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON feh.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = (SELECT MAX(census_year) FROM dim_time)\nGROUP BY dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nORDER BY total_health_social_establishments DESC;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "f89a1184", "question": "Elenca il nome del sub-district e l'anno del censimento, insieme alla somma totale dei valori stimati dell'istruzione e dei valori stimati della salute umana e dei servizi sociali, per ciascun sub-district e anno di censimento in cui tale somma sia almeno 0.000, ordinati per anno di censimento e per somma totale in ordine decrescente.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T2.CENSUS_YEAR, SUM(T3.EST_EDUCATION + T3.EST_HUMAN_HEALTH_SOCIAL) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 INNER JOIN FACT_EDUCATION_HEALTH AS T3 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T3.LOCATION_ID INNER JOIN DIM_TIME AS T2 ON T3.TIME_ID = T2.TIME_ID GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T2.CENSUS_YEAR HAVING SUM(T3.EST_EDUCATION + T3.EST_HUMAN_HEALTH_SOCIAL) >= 0.000 ORDER BY T2.CENSUS_YEAR DESC, SUM(T3.EST_EDUCATION + T3.EST_HUMAN_HEALTH_SOCIAL) DESC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, dt.census_year, SUM(feh.est_education + feh.est_human_health_social) AS total_sum\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_education_health feh ON dl.location_id = feh.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON feh.time_id = dt.time_id\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name, dt.census_year\nHAVING SUM(feh.est_education + feh.est_human_health_social) >= 0.000\nORDER BY dt.census_year, total_sum DESC;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, dt.census_year, SUM(feh.est_education + feh.est_human_health_social) AS total_sum\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_education_health feh ON dl.location_id = feh.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON feh.time_id = dt.time_id\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name, dt.census_year\nHAVING SUM(feh.est_education + feh.est_human_health_social) >= 0.000\nORDER BY dt.census_year, total_sum DESC;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "e9ab06a4", "question": "Per l'anno del censimento 2013, elenca i nomi dei sottodistretti e la somma totale stimata dell'istruzione e della sanità umana e dei servizi sociali, ordinati in base a questa somma combinata in ordine decrescente per i primi 5 sottodistretti.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_EDUCATION + T2.EST_HUMAN_HEALTH_SOCIAL) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_EDUCATION_HEALTH AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_EDUCATION + T2.EST_HUMAN_HEALTH_SOCIAL) DESC LIMIT 5", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(feh.est_education + feh.est_human_health_social) AS combined_sum\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_education_health feh ON dl.location_id = feh.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON feh.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY combined_sum DESC\nLIMIT 5;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(feh.est_education + feh.est_human_health_social) AS combined_sum\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_education_health feh ON dl.location_id = feh.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON feh.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY combined_sum DESC\nLIMIT 5;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "c197494e", "question": "Per l’anno di censimento più recente disponibile, elenca i nomi dei sottodistretti e la somma totale stimata dell’istruzione e della sanità umana e dei servizi sociali, mostrando i 5 sottodistretti con i totali combinati più elevati.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_EDUCATION + T2.EST_HUMAN_HEALTH_SOCIAL) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_EDUCATION_HEALTH AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = (SELECT MAX(CENSUS_YEAR) FROM DIM_TIME) GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_EDUCATION + T2.EST_HUMAN_HEALTH_SOCIAL) DESC LIMIT 5", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(feh.est_education + feh.est_human_health_social) AS total_combined\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_education_health feh ON dl.location_id = feh.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON feh.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = (SELECT MAX(census_year) FROM dim_time)\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_combined DESC\nLIMIT 5;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(feh.est_education + feh.est_human_health_social) AS total_combined\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_education_health feh ON dl.location_id = feh.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON feh.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = (SELECT MAX(census_year) FROM dim_time)\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_combined DESC\nLIMIT 5;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "ad513455", "question": "Per l'anno di censimento 2013, elenca i nomi dei sub-district in cui il valore stimato della salute umana e dell'assistenza sociale è maggiore di 0.000, ma la somma totale stimata dell'istruzione è esattamente 0.000, ordinati alfabeticamente per nome del sub-district.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_EDUCATION_HEALTH AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' AND T2.EST_HUMAN_HEALTH_SOCIAL > 0.000 GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_EDUCATION) = 0.000 ORDER BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME", "predicted_sql": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_education_health feh ON dl.location_id = feh.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON feh.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND feh.est_human_health_social > 0.000\n  AND feh.est_education = 0.000\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "raw_output": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_education_health feh ON dl.location_id = feh.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON feh.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND feh.est_human_health_social > 0.000\n  AND feh.est_education = 0.000\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Mismatch (Order matters: True). Gold count: 1141. Pred count: 1378."}
{"pair_id": "f9a67de8", "question": "Elenca i nomi dei sub-district per l'anno di censimento 2013 in cui il valore totale stimato per la salute umana e l'assistenza sociale è maggiore di 0.000 e il valore totale stimato per l'istruzione è esattamente 0.000, ordinati alfabeticamente per nome del sub-district.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_EDUCATION_HEALTH AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_HUMAN_HEALTH_SOCIAL) > 0.000 AND SUM(T2.EST_EDUCATION) = 0.000 ORDER BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ASC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_education_health feh ON dl.location_id = feh.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON feh.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND feh.est_human_health_social > 0.000\n  AND feh.est_education = 0.000\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "raw_output": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_education_health feh ON dl.location_id = feh.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON feh.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND feh.est_human_health_social > 0.000\n  AND feh.est_education = 0.000\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Mismatch (Order matters: True). Gold count: 921. Pred count: 1378."}
{"pair_id": "08065fd9", "question": "Elenca i nomi dei sub-district per l'anno di censimento 2013, raggruppati per nome del sub-district, in cui sia la somma stimata dell'istruzione sia la somma stimata della salute umana e dell'assistenza sociale siano entrambe almeno pari a 0.000, e ordina i risultati alfabeticamente per nome del sub-district.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_EDUCATION_HEALTH AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_EDUCATION) >= 0.000 AND SUM(T2.EST_HUMAN_HEALTH_SOCIAL) >= 0.000 ORDER BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ASC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_education_health feh ON dl.location_id = feh.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON feh.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nHAVING SUM(feh.est_education) >= 0.000 AND SUM(feh.est_human_health_social) >= 0.000\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_education_health feh ON dl.location_id = feh.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON feh.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nHAVING SUM(feh.est_education) >= 0.000 AND SUM(feh.est_human_health_social) >= 0.000\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "09a62cf5", "question": "Per l'anno di censimento 2013, elenca i nomi dei villaggi ULB RLB e i corrispondenti nomi dei sotto-distretti, specificamente per le località in cui la somma dei valori stimati dell'istruzione è almeno pari a 1.000 e la somma dei valori stimati della salute umana e dei servizi sociali è almeno pari a 1.000, ordinati alfabeticamente per nome del sotto-distretto.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME, T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_EDUCATION_HEALTH AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME, T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_EDUCATION) >= 1.000 AND SUM(T2.EST_HUMAN_HEALTH_SOCIAL) >= 1.000 ORDER BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ASC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_education_health feh ON dl.location_id = feh.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON feh.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.location_id, dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nHAVING SUM(feh.est_education) >= 1.000 AND SUM(feh.est_human_health_social) >= 1.000\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_education_health feh ON dl.location_id = feh.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON feh.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.location_id, dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nHAVING SUM(feh.est_education) >= 1.000 AND SUM(feh.est_human_health_social) >= 1.000\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Mismatch (Order matters: True). Gold count: 753. Pred count: 759."}
{"pair_id": "d5b2cc85", "question": "Elenca i nomi dei sotto-distretti e i nomi dei villaggi ULB/RLB in cui il numero totale di stabilimenti di proprietà femminile è superiore al numero totale di stabilimenti di proprietà maschile.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_GENDER_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_FEMALE) > SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_MALE)", "predicted_sql": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_gender_ownership fgo ON dl.location_id = fgo.location_id\nWHERE fgo.est_owned_by_female > fgo.est_owned_by_male;", "raw_output": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_gender_ownership fgo ON dl.location_id = fgo.location_id\nWHERE fgo.est_owned_by_female > fgo.est_owned_by_male;", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Mismatch (Order matters: False). Gold count: 2080. Pred count: 2082."}
{"pair_id": "3222d0c9", "question": "Per l’anno di censimento più recente disponibile, elenca il nome di ciascun sottodistretto insieme alla somma totale degli stabilimenti di proprietà femminile, raggruppati per sottodistretto e ordinati dal totale più alto al più basso.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_FEMALE) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_GENDER_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = (SELECT MAX(CENSUS_YEAR) FROM DIM_TIME) GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_FEMALE) DESC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fgo.est_owned_by_female) AS total_female_owned_establishments\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_gender_ownership fgo ON dl.location_id = fgo.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fgo.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = (SELECT MAX(census_year) FROM dim_time)\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_female_owned_establishments DESC;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fgo.est_owned_by_female) AS total_female_owned_establishments\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_gender_ownership fgo ON dl.location_id = fgo.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fgo.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = (SELECT MAX(census_year) FROM dim_time)\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_female_owned_establishments DESC;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "58b60029", "question": "Per l’anno di censimento più recente disponibile, elenca il nome di ciascun sottodistretto e la somma totale degli esercizi di proprietà femminile, raggruppati per sottodistretto e ordinati dalla somma più alta alla più bassa.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_FEMALE) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_GENDER_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = (SELECT MAX(CENSUS_YEAR) FROM DIM_TIME) GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_FEMALE) DESC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fgo.est_owned_by_female) AS total_female_owned_establishments\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_gender_ownership fgo ON dl.location_id = fgo.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fgo.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = (SELECT MAX(census_year) FROM dim_time)\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_female_owned_establishments DESC;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fgo.est_owned_by_female) AS total_female_owned_establishments\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_gender_ownership fgo ON dl.location_id = fgo.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fgo.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = (SELECT MAX(census_year) FROM dim_time)\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_female_owned_establishments DESC;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "9e644c4d", "question": "Per l'anno di censimento 2013, considerando solo il record con l'ID temporale massimo disponibile, elenca i nomi degli ULB, RLB o dei villaggi in cui la somma totale degli stabilimenti di proprietà femminile è esattamente pari a zero.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_GENDER_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' AND T3.TIME_ID = (SELECT MAX(TIME_ID) FROM DIM_TIME) GROUP BY T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_FEMALE) = 0.000", "predicted_sql": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_gender_ownership fgo ON dl.location_id = fgo.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fgo.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND fgo.time_id = (SELECT MAX(time_id) FROM dim_time WHERE census_year = 2013)\n  AND fgo.est_owned_by_female = 0;", "raw_output": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_gender_ownership fgo ON dl.location_id = fgo.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fgo.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND fgo.time_id = (SELECT MAX(time_id) FROM dim_time WHERE census_year = 2013)\n  AND fgo.est_owned_by_female = 0;", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Mismatch (Order matters: False). Gold count: 14649. Pred count: 15461."}
{"pair_id": "79e89edd", "question": "Per l'anno del censimento 2013, elenca il nome di ciascun sotto-distretto e la somma totale degli esercizi di proprietà femminile, raggruppati per sotto-distretto e ordinati dal totale più alto al più basso.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_FEMALE) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_GENDER_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_FEMALE) DESC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fgo.est_owned_by_female) AS total_female_owned_establishments\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_gender_ownership fgo ON dl.location_id = fgo.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fgo.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_female_owned_establishments DESC;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fgo.est_owned_by_female) AS total_female_owned_establishments\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_gender_ownership fgo ON dl.location_id = fgo.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fgo.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_female_owned_establishments DESC;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "bf70d789", "question": "Per l'anno del censimento 2013, elenca i nomi dei sottodistretti e il numero totale di stabilimenti di proprietà femminile per ciascun sottodistretto, mostrando solo i primi 5 sottodistretti con i totali più elevati.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_FEMALE) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_GENDER_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_FEMALE) DESC LIMIT 5", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fgo.est_owned_by_female) AS total_female_owned_establishments\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_gender_ownership fgo ON dl.location_id = fgo.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fgo.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_female_owned_establishments DESC\nLIMIT 5;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fgo.est_owned_by_female) AS total_female_owned_establishments\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_gender_ownership fgo ON dl.location_id = fgo.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fgo.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_female_owned_establishments DESC\nLIMIT 5;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "64e64570", "question": "Per l’anno di censimento più recente disponibile, elenca il nome di ciascun sottodistretto e la somma totale degli esercizi di proprietà femminile, raggruppati per sottodistretto e ordinati dal conteggio più alto a quello più basso.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_FEMALE) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_GENDER_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = (SELECT MAX(CENSUS_YEAR) FROM DIM_TIME) GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_FEMALE) DESC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fgo.est_owned_by_female) AS total_female_owned_establishments\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_gender_ownership fgo ON dl.location_id = fgo.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fgo.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = (SELECT MAX(census_year) FROM dim_time)\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_female_owned_establishments DESC;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fgo.est_owned_by_female) AS total_female_owned_establishments\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_gender_ownership fgo ON dl.location_id = fgo.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fgo.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = (SELECT MAX(census_year) FROM dim_time)\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_female_owned_establishments DESC;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "b766b4e4", "question": "Elenca i nomi dei sottodistretti, ordinati alfabeticamente, per i record in cui o l'anno del censimento è 2013 e il nome del villaggio è 'Chouldari (Rv)' oppure il numero di stabilimenti posseduti da altri generi è 0.000, assicurando che esista almeno un record temporale per ciascun sottodistretto.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T2.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM FACT_GENDER_OWNERSHIP AS T1 JOIN DIM_LOCATION AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T1.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE (T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' AND T2.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME = 'Chouldari (Rv)') OR T1.EST_OWNED_BY_OTHER_GENDER = 0.000 GROUP BY T2.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING COUNT(T3.TIME_ID) > 0 ORDER BY T2.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ASC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_gender_ownership fgo ON dl.location_id = fgo.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fgo.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE (dt.census_year = 2013 AND dl.ulb_rlb_village_name ILIKE 'Chouldari (Rv)')\n   OR fgo.est_owned_by_other_gender = 0.000\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "raw_output": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_gender_ownership fgo ON dl.location_id = fgo.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fgo.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE (dt.census_year = 2013 AND dl.ulb_rlb_village_name ILIKE 'Chouldari (Rv)')\n   OR fgo.est_owned_by_other_gender = 0.000\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "0783bd49", "question": "Per l'anno di censimento 2013, elenca il nome di ciascun sotto-distretto e il nome del villaggio ULB/RLB insieme al numero totale di stabilimenti di proprietà femminile, includendo solo le località in cui il numero di proprietà femminili è maggiore di zero, e ordina i risultati dal totale di proprietà più alto al più basso.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_FEMALE) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_GENDER_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_FEMALE) > 0.000 ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_FEMALE) DESC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name, SUM(fgo.est_owned_by_female) AS total_female_owned\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_gender_ownership fgo ON dl.location_id = fgo.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fgo.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nHAVING SUM(fgo.est_owned_by_female) > 0\nORDER BY total_female_owned DESC;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name, SUM(fgo.est_owned_by_female) AS total_female_owned\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_gender_ownership fgo ON dl.location_id = fgo.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fgo.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nHAVING SUM(fgo.est_owned_by_female) > 0\nORDER BY total_female_owned DESC;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "c7d19184", "question": "Per l'anno del censimento 2013, elenca i nomi dei sotto-distretti e i nomi dei villaggi ULB/RLB insieme alla somma totale degli esercizi posseduti da Sikh, raggruppati per sotto-distretto e nome del villaggio e ordinati in ordine decrescente in base alla somma.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_RELIGIOUS_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) DESC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name, SUM(fro.est_owned_by_sikh) AS total_sikh_owned_establishments\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_religious_ownership fro ON dl.location_id = fro.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fro.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nORDER BY total_sikh_owned_establishments DESC;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name, SUM(fro.est_owned_by_sikh) AS total_sikh_owned_establishments\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_religious_ownership fro ON dl.location_id = fro.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fro.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nORDER BY total_sikh_owned_establishments DESC;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "1d4a3e0b", "question": "Per l'anno del censimento 2013, elenca i nomi dei sottodistretti in cui il numero di imprese di proprietà femminile è maggiore di zero, assicurandoti che ciascun nome di sottodistretto sia incluso solo se ha almeno un record.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_GENDER_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' AND T2.EST_OWNED_BY_FEMALE > 0.000 GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING COUNT(T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME) > 0", "predicted_sql": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_gender_ownership fgo ON dl.location_id = fgo.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fgo.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND fgo.est_owned_by_female > 0;", "raw_output": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_gender_ownership fgo ON dl.location_id = fgo.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fgo.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND fgo.est_owned_by_female > 0;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "47e9d55d", "question": "Per l'anno del censimento 2013, elenca i nomi dei sottodistretti e i nomi dei villaggi ULB/RLB insieme alla somma totale degli esercizi di proprietà dei Sikh, raggruppati sia per sottodistretto sia per nome del villaggio.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_RELIGIOUS_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name, SUM(fro.est_owned_by_sikh) AS total_sikh_owned_establishments\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_religious_ownership fro ON dl.location_id = fro.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fro.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name, SUM(fro.est_owned_by_sikh) AS total_sikh_owned_establishments\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_religious_ownership fro ON dl.location_id = fro.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fro.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "cb5b8b67", "question": "Elenca i nomi dei sub-district per l'anno di censimento 2013, ordinati in base al numero stimato di religious properties possedute dai Sikhs in ordine decrescente.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_RELIGIOUS_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' ORDER BY T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH DESC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_religious_ownership fro ON dl.location_id = fro.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fro.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nORDER BY fro.est_owned_by_sikh DESC;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_religious_ownership fro ON dl.location_id = fro.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fro.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nORDER BY fro.est_owned_by_sikh DESC;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "e5c96235", "question": "Per l’anno di censimento più recente disponibile, elenca il nome di ciascun sottodistretto insieme al numero totale di stabilimenti di proprietà di indù, al totale di quelli di proprietà di musulmani e al totale di quelli di proprietà di cristiani, ordinati in ordine decrescente in base alla somma complessiva di queste tre categorie di proprietà religiosa.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_HINDU), SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_ISLAM), SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_CHRISTIAN) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_RELIGIOUS_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = (SELECT MAX(CENSUS_YEAR) FROM DIM_TIME) GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_HINDU + T2.EST_OWNED_BY_ISLAM + T2.EST_OWNED_BY_CHRISTIAN) DESC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT\n    dl.sub_district_name,\n    SUM(fro.est_owned_by_hindu) AS total_hindu_owned,\n    SUM(fro.est_owned_by_islam) AS total_muslim_owned,\n    SUM(fro.est_owned_by_christian) AS total_christian_owned,\n    SUM(fro.est_owned_by_hindu + fro.est_owned_by_islam + fro.est_owned_by_christian) AS total_three_religions\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_religious_ownership fro ON dl.location_id = fro.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fro.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = (SELECT MAX(census_year) FROM dim_time)\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_three_religions DESC;", "raw_output": "SELECT\n    dl.sub_district_name,\n    SUM(fro.est_owned_by_hindu) AS total_hindu_owned,\n    SUM(fro.est_owned_by_islam) AS total_muslim_owned,\n    SUM(fro.est_owned_by_christian) AS total_christian_owned,\n    SUM(fro.est_owned_by_hindu + fro.est_owned_by_islam + fro.est_owned_by_christian) AS total_three_religions\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_religious_ownership fro ON dl.location_id = fro.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fro.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = (SELECT MAX(census_year) FROM dim_time)\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_three_religions DESC;", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Mismatch (Order matters: True). Gold count: 5346. Pred count: 5346."}
{"pair_id": "b04846f6", "question": "Elenca i nomi dei sottodistretti e il numero totale di esercizi di proprietà di Sikh per il periodo di tempo con ID 1, raggruppati per sottodistretto e ordinati in base al conteggio più alto in ordine decrescente, mostrando solo i primi 5 risultati.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_RELIGIOUS_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID WHERE T2.TIME_ID = 1 GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) DESC LIMIT 5", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fro.est_owned_by_sikh) AS total_sikh_owned\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_religious_ownership fro ON dl.location_id = fro.location_id\nWHERE fro.time_id = 1\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_sikh_owned DESC\nLIMIT 5;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fro.est_owned_by_sikh) AS total_sikh_owned\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_religious_ownership fro ON dl.location_id = fro.location_id\nWHERE fro.time_id = 1\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_sikh_owned DESC\nLIMIT 5;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "9382a4a2", "question": "Per l'anno del censimento 2013, elenca il nome di ciascun sottodistretto e la somma totale degli esercizi posseduti da Sikh, ordinati in ordine decrescente in base a tale somma totale.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_RELIGIOUS_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) DESC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fro.est_owned_by_sikh) AS total_sikh_owned\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_religious_ownership fro ON dl.location_id = fro.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fro.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_sikh_owned DESC;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fro.est_owned_by_sikh) AS total_sikh_owned\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_religious_ownership fro ON dl.location_id = fro.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fro.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_sikh_owned DESC;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "ffc386b1", "question": "Elenca i nomi dei sottodistretti e il numero totale di esercizi di proprietà di Sikh, specificamente per quelli in cui lo stato del commercio al dettaglio è \"1.000\", raggruppati per sottodistretto e ordinati in base alla somma degli esercizi di proprietà di Sikh in ordine decrescente per i primi 5 risultati.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_RELIGIOUS_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN FACT_TRADE_SECTOR AS T3 ON T2.LOCATION_ID = T3.LOCATION_ID WHERE T3.EST_RETAIL_TRADE = '1.000' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) DESC LIMIT 5", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fro.est_owned_by_sikh) AS total_sikh_owned\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_trade_sector fts ON dl.location_id = fts.location_id\nJOIN fact_religious_ownership fro ON dl.location_id = fro.location_id\nWHERE fts.est_retail_trade = 1.000\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_sikh_owned DESC\nLIMIT 5;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(fro.est_owned_by_sikh) AS total_sikh_owned\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_trade_sector fts ON dl.location_id = fts.location_id\nJOIN fact_religious_ownership fro ON dl.location_id = fro.location_id\nWHERE fts.est_retail_trade = 1.000\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_sikh_owned DESC\nLIMIT 5;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "a80ce3c9", "question": "Per l'anno di censimento 2013, elenca i nomi dei sub-district e i nomi dei village ULB/RLB per le località in cui la proprietà stimata da parte dei Sikh è maggiore o uguale a 0.000, ordinati alfabeticamente per nome del sub-district.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_RELIGIOUS_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH >= 0.000 AND T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' ORDER BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_religious_ownership fro ON dl.location_id = fro.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fro.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013 AND fro.est_owned_by_sikh >= 0.000\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_religious_ownership fro ON dl.location_id = fro.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fro.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013 AND fro.est_owned_by_sikh >= 0.000\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "a994e9a8", "question": "Per l'anno di censimento 2013, elenca il nome di ciascun sotto-distretto e il nome del villaggio ULB/RLB, insieme alla somma totale degli stabilimenti di proprietà dei Sikh, dove tale somma è almeno pari a zero, e ordina i risultati in base alla somma totale in ordine decrescente.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_RELIGIOUS_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' AND T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH >= 0.000 GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) >= 0.000 ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) DESC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name, SUM(fro.est_owned_by_sikh) AS total_sikh_owned_establishments\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_religious_ownership fro ON dl.location_id = fro.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fro.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nHAVING SUM(fro.est_owned_by_sikh) >= 0\nORDER BY total_sikh_owned_establishments DESC;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name, SUM(fro.est_owned_by_sikh) AS total_sikh_owned_establishments\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_religious_ownership fro ON dl.location_id = fro.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fro.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nHAVING SUM(fro.est_owned_by_sikh) >= 0\nORDER BY total_sikh_owned_establishments DESC;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "2ad8247d", "question": "Elenca i nomi dei sub-district per l'anno di censimento 2013 in cui il numero totale di establishments di proprietà dei Sikh è maggiore di zero e il numero totale di establishments di proprietà dei Jains è esattamente zero, raggruppati e ordinati alfabeticamente per nome del sub-district.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_RELIGIOUS_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) > 0.000 AND SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_JAIN) = 0.000 ORDER BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ASC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_religious_ownership fro ON dl.location_id = fro.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fro.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND fro.est_owned_by_sikh > 0\n  AND fro.est_owned_by_jain = 0\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "raw_output": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_religious_ownership fro ON dl.location_id = fro.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fro.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND fro.est_owned_by_sikh > 0\n  AND fro.est_owned_by_jain = 0\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Mismatch (Order matters: True). Gold count: 286. Pred count: 374."}
{"pair_id": "e591a0fb", "question": "Elenca i nomi dei sub-district dell'anno di censimento 2013 in cui è presente almeno un establishments di proprietà dei Sikh, ma in cui la somma totale degli establishments di proprietà dei Jains in quel sub-district è esattamente zero.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_RELIGIOUS_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' AND T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH > 0.000 GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_JAIN) = 0.000", "predicted_sql": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_religious_ownership fro ON dl.location_id = fro.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fro.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND fro.est_owned_by_sikh > 0\n  AND dl.location_id IN (\n      SELECT dl2.location_id\n      FROM dim_location dl2\n      JOIN fact_religious_ownership fro2 ON dl2.location_id = fro2.location_id\n      JOIN dim_time dt2 ON fro2.time_id = dt2.time_id\n      WHERE dt2.census_year = 2013\n      GROUP BY dl2.sub_district_name, dl2.location_id\n      HAVING SUM(fro2.est_owned_by_jain) = 0\n  );", "raw_output": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_religious_ownership fro ON dl.location_id = fro.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fro.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND fro.est_owned_by_sikh > 0\n  AND dl.location_id IN (\n      SELECT dl2.location_id\n      FROM dim_location dl2\n      JOIN fact_religious_ownership fro2 ON dl2.location_id = fro2.location_id\n      JOIN dim_time dt2 ON fro2.time_id = dt2.time_id\n      WHERE dt2.census_year = 2013\n      GROUP BY dl2.sub_district_name, dl2.location_id\n      HAVING SUM(fro2.est_owned_by_jain) = 0\n  );", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Mismatch (Order matters: False). Gold count: 351. Pred count: 374."}
{"pair_id": "3fffc294", "question": "Elenca i nomi dei sub-district in cui, per l'anno di censimento 2013, il numero totale di establishments di proprietà dei Sikh oppure il numero totale di establishments di proprietà dei Jains è superiore a 500.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_RELIGIOUS_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) > 500 OR SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_JAIN) > 500", "predicted_sql": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_religious_ownership fro ON dl.location_id = fro.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fro.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND (fro.est_owned_by_sikh > 500 OR fro.est_owned_by_jain > 500);", "raw_output": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_religious_ownership fro ON dl.location_id = fro.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON fro.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND (fro.est_owned_by_sikh > 500 OR fro.est_owned_by_jain > 500);", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Mismatch (Order matters: False). Gold count: 4. Pred count: 1."}
{"pair_id": "4d623596", "question": "Elenca il nome del sottodistretto, il nome del villaggio ULB/RLB e il nome del distretto per i distretti di Chittoor, South Andamans e Nicobars, assicurandoti che ogni combinazione abbia almeno un ID località, e ordina i risultati alfabeticamente per nome del sottodistretto.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T2.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T2.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME, T1.DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_DISTRICT AS T1 INNER JOIN DIM_LOCATION AS T2 ON T1.DISTRICT_ID = T2.DISTRICT_ID WHERE T1.DISTRICT_NAME IN ('Chittoor', 'South Andamans', 'Nicobars') GROUP BY T2.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T2.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME, T1.DISTRICT_NAME HAVING COUNT(T2.LOCATION_ID) >= 1 ORDER BY T2.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ASC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name, dd.district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN dim_district dd ON dl.district_id = dd.district_id\nWHERE dd.district_name ILIKE 'Chittoor' OR dd.district_name ILIKE 'South Andamans' OR dd.district_name ILIKE 'Nicobars'\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "raw_output": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name, dl.ulb_rlb_village_name, dd.district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN dim_district dd ON dl.district_id = dd.district_id\nWHERE dd.district_name ILIKE 'Chittoor' OR dd.district_name ILIKE 'South Andamans' OR dd.district_name ILIKE 'Nicobars'\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Mismatch (Order matters: True). Gold count: 95. Pred count: 95."}
{"pair_id": "f279081a", "question": "Per ogni sottodistretto, elenca il nome del sottodistretto, il totale stimato dei finanziamenti provenienti da istituti di credito e il totale stimato dei finanziamenti provenienti da prestiti di gruppi di auto-aiuto, ordinati in ordine decrescente in base al totale stimato dei finanziamenti provenienti da istituti di credito.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_BORROW_INSTITUTION), SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_LOAN_SELF_HELP_GROUP) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_FINANCE_SOURCES AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_BORROW_INSTITUTION) DESC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name,\n       SUM(ffs.est_finance_borrow_institution) AS total_finance_institution,\n       SUM(ffs.est_finance_loan_self_help_group) AS total_finance_self_help_group\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_finance_sources ffs ON dl.location_id = ffs.location_id\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_finance_institution DESC;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name,\n       SUM(ffs.est_finance_borrow_institution) AS total_finance_institution,\n       SUM(ffs.est_finance_loan_self_help_group) AS total_finance_self_help_group\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_finance_sources ffs ON dl.location_id = ffs.location_id\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_finance_institution DESC;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "414ab4d4", "question": "Elenca i nomi degli ULB, degli RLB o dei villaggi, ordinati alfabeticamente, che hanno un importo stimato di assistenza finanziaria governativa pari a 0.000 e un importo stimato di finanziamento tramite prestito del gruppo di auto-aiuto pari a 0.000.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_FINANCE_SOURCES AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID WHERE T2.EST_FINANCE_GOVT_ASSISTANCE = 0.000 AND T2.EST_FINANCE_LOAN_SELF_HELP_GROUP = 0.000 GROUP BY T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME ORDER BY T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME ASC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_finance_sources ffs ON dl.location_id = ffs.location_id\nWHERE ffs.est_finance_govt_assistance = 0.000\n  AND ffs.est_finance_loan_self_help_group = 0.000\nORDER BY dl.ulb_rlb_village_name;", "raw_output": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_finance_sources ffs ON dl.location_id = ffs.location_id\nWHERE ffs.est_finance_govt_assistance = 0.000\n  AND ffs.est_finance_loan_self_help_group = 0.000\nORDER BY dl.ulb_rlb_village_name;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "0d4f65de", "question": "Per ciascun nome di sottodistretto nella categoria del settore rurale, elenca il nome del sottodistretto insieme al totale stimato dei finanziamenti da prestiti istituzionali e al totale stimato dei finanziamenti da prestiti dei gruppi di autoaiuto, a condizione che il totale dei prestiti istituzionali sia maggiore di zero, e ordina i risultati in base al totale dei prestiti istituzionali in ordine decrescente.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_BORROW_INSTITUTION) AS total_institutional_borrowing, SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_LOAN_SELF_HELP_GROUP) AS total_shg_loans FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 INNER JOIN FACT_FINANCE_SOURCES AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID INNER JOIN DIM_SECTOR_CATEGORY AS T3 ON T2.SECTOR_ID = T3.SECTOR_ID WHERE T3.SECTOR_CATEGORY = 'Rural' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_BORROW_INSTITUTION) > 0.000 ORDER BY total_institutional_borrowing DESC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name,\n       SUM(ffs.est_finance_borrow_institution) AS total_institutional_loans,\n       SUM(ffs.est_finance_loan_self_help_group) AS total_self_help_group_loans\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_finance_sources ffs ON dl.location_id = ffs.location_id\nJOIN dim_sector_category dsc ON ffs.sector_id = dsc.sector_id\nWHERE dsc.sector_category ILIKE 'rural'\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nHAVING SUM(ffs.est_finance_borrow_institution) > 0\nORDER BY total_institutional_loans DESC;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name,\n       SUM(ffs.est_finance_borrow_institution) AS total_institutional_loans,\n       SUM(ffs.est_finance_loan_self_help_group) AS total_self_help_group_loans\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_finance_sources ffs ON dl.location_id = ffs.location_id\nJOIN dim_sector_category dsc ON ffs.sector_id = dsc.sector_id\nWHERE dsc.sector_category ILIKE 'rural'\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nHAVING SUM(ffs.est_finance_borrow_institution) > 0\nORDER BY total_institutional_loans DESC;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "fba7fb6b", "question": "Elenca i nomi degli ULB, degli RLB o dei villaggi che hanno almeno un record di fonte di finanziamento, ma specificamente in cui l’assistenza governativa stimata è pari a 0.000 e anche il prestito stimato dai gruppi di auto-aiuto è pari a 0.000, ordinati alfabeticamente per nome del villaggio.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_FINANCE_SOURCES AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID WHERE T2.EST_FINANCE_GOVT_ASSISTANCE = 0.000 AND T2.EST_FINANCE_LOAN_SELF_HELP_GROUP = 0.000 GROUP BY T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME HAVING COUNT(T2.FACT_FINANCE_SOURCES_ID) > 0 ORDER BY T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME ASC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_finance_sources ffs ON dl.location_id = ffs.location_id\nWHERE ffs.est_finance_govt_assistance = 0.000\n  AND ffs.est_finance_loan_self_help_group = 0.000\nORDER BY dl.ulb_rlb_village_name;", "raw_output": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_finance_sources ffs ON dl.location_id = ffs.location_id\nWHERE ffs.est_finance_govt_assistance = 0.000\n  AND ffs.est_finance_loan_self_help_group = 0.000\nORDER BY dl.ulb_rlb_village_name;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "d08fd177", "question": "Per l’anno di censimento più recente disponibile, elenca il nome di ciascun sottodistretto e il totale stimato dell’assistenza finanziaria governativa, raggruppati per nome del sottodistretto e ordinati dal totale dell’assistenza più alto al più basso.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_GOVT_ASSISTANCE) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_FINANCE_SOURCES AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = (SELECT MAX(CENSUS_YEAR) FROM DIM_TIME) GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_GOVT_ASSISTANCE) DESC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(ffs.est_finance_govt_assistance) AS total_govt_assistance\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_finance_sources ffs ON dl.location_id = ffs.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON ffs.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = (SELECT MAX(census_year) FROM dim_time)\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_govt_assistance DESC;", "raw_output": "SELECT dl.sub_district_name, SUM(ffs.est_finance_govt_assistance) AS total_govt_assistance\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_finance_sources ffs ON dl.location_id = ffs.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON ffs.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = (SELECT MAX(census_year) FROM dim_time)\nGROUP BY dl.sub_district_name\nORDER BY total_govt_assistance DESC;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "309a5f49", "question": "Elenca i nomi dei sub-district dell'anno di censimento 2013 in cui il totale stimato dei finanziamenti di assistenza governativa è maggiore di 0.000 e il totale stimato dei finanziamenti provenienti da gruppi di auto-aiuto con prestito è esattamente 0.000, ordinati alfabeticamente per nome del sub-district.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_FINANCE_SOURCES AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_GOVT_ASSISTANCE) > 0.000 AND SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_LOAN_SELF_HELP_GROUP) = 0.000 ORDER BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ASC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_finance_sources ffs ON dl.location_id = ffs.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON ffs.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND ffs.est_finance_govt_assistance > 0.000\n  AND ffs.est_finance_loan_self_help_group = 0.000\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "raw_output": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_finance_sources ffs ON dl.location_id = ffs.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON ffs.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND ffs.est_finance_govt_assistance > 0.000\n  AND ffs.est_finance_loan_self_help_group = 0.000\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Mismatch (Order matters: True). Gold count: 1965. Pred count: 2361."}
{"pair_id": "bb7e100c", "question": "Elenca i nomi dei sub-district per l'anno di censimento 2013 in cui il totale stimato dei finanziamenti dell'assistenza governativa è maggiore di 0.000 e il totale stimato dei finanziamenti provenienti dai gruppi di auto-aiuto basati su prestiti è esattamente 0.000.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_FINANCE_SOURCES AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_GOVT_ASSISTANCE) > 0.000 AND SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_LOAN_SELF_HELP_GROUP) = 0.000", "predicted_sql": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_finance_sources ffs ON dl.location_id = ffs.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON ffs.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND ffs.est_finance_govt_assistance > 0.000\n  AND ffs.est_finance_loan_self_help_group = 0.000;", "raw_output": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_finance_sources ffs ON dl.location_id = ffs.location_id\nJOIN dim_time dt ON ffs.time_id = dt.time_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = 2013\n  AND ffs.est_finance_govt_assistance > 0.000\n  AND ffs.est_finance_loan_self_help_group = 0.000;", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Mismatch (Order matters: False). Gold count: 1965. Pred count: 2361."}
{"pair_id": "471bea0a", "question": "Elenca i nomi dei sub-district, ordinati alfabeticamente, per le aree in cui il finanziamento stimato derivante dall'assistenza governativa è pari a 0.000 e anche il finanziamento stimato preso in prestito da istituzioni è pari a 0.000.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_FINANCE_SOURCES AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID WHERE T2.EST_FINANCE_GOVT_ASSISTANCE = 0.000 AND T2.EST_FINANCE_BORROW_INSTITUTION = 0.000 GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ASC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_finance_sources ffs ON dl.location_id = ffs.location_id\nWHERE ffs.est_finance_govt_assistance = 0.000\n  AND ffs.est_finance_borrow_institution = 0.000\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "raw_output": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_finance_sources ffs ON dl.location_id = ffs.location_id\nWHERE ffs.est_finance_govt_assistance = 0.000\n  AND ffs.est_finance_borrow_institution = 0.000\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "a457d390", "question": "Per l’anno di censimento più recente disponibile, elenca il nome di ciascun villaggio ULB/RLB insieme al totale stimato dell’assistenza finanziaria governativa e al totale stimato dei finanziamenti provenienti da istituti di credito, raggruppati per nome del villaggio e ordinati in ordine decrescente in base al totale dell’assistenza governativa.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_GOVT_ASSISTANCE), SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_BORROW_INSTITUTION) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_FINANCE_SOURCES AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = (SELECT MAX(CENSUS_YEAR) FROM DIM_TIME) GROUP BY T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_GOVT_ASSISTANCE) DESC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT \n    dl.ulb_rlb_village_name,\n    SUM(ffs.est_finance_govt_assistance) AS total_govt_assistance,\n    SUM(ffs.est_finance_borrow_institution) AS total_institutional_finance\nFROM dim_time dt\nJOIN fact_finance_sources ffs ON dt.time_id = ffs.time_id\nJOIN dim_location dl ON ffs.location_id = dl.location_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = (SELECT MAX(census_year) FROM dim_time)\nGROUP BY dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nORDER BY total_govt_assistance DESC;", "raw_output": "SELECT \n    dl.ulb_rlb_village_name,\n    SUM(ffs.est_finance_govt_assistance) AS total_govt_assistance,\n    SUM(ffs.est_finance_borrow_institution) AS total_institutional_finance\nFROM dim_time dt\nJOIN fact_finance_sources ffs ON dt.time_id = ffs.time_id\nJOIN dim_location dl ON ffs.location_id = dl.location_id\nWHERE dt.census_year = (SELECT MAX(census_year) FROM dim_time)\nGROUP BY dl.ulb_rlb_village_name\nORDER BY total_govt_assistance DESC;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
{"pair_id": "c4e8af4a", "question": "Elenca i nomi dei sub-district, ordinati alfabeticamente, per tutti i sub-district che hanno almeno un record di fonte di finanziamento in cui sia l'assistenza finanziaria governativa stimata sia l'importo stimato preso in prestito da istituzioni sono pari a 0.000.", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_FINANCE_SOURCES AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T2.EST_FINANCE_GOVT_ASSISTANCE = 0.000 AND T2.EST_FINANCE_BORROW_INSTITUTION = 0.000 GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING COUNT(T2.FACT_FINANCE_SOURCES_ID) > 0 ORDER BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ASC", "predicted_sql": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_finance_sources ffs ON dl.location_id = ffs.location_id\nWHERE ffs.est_finance_govt_assistance = 0.000 AND ffs.est_finance_borrow_institution = 0.000\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "raw_output": "SELECT DISTINCT dl.sub_district_name\nFROM dim_location dl\nJOIN fact_finance_sources ffs ON dl.location_id = ffs.location_id\nWHERE ffs.est_finance_govt_assistance = 0.000 AND ffs.est_finance_borrow_institution = 0.000\nORDER BY dl.sub_district_name;", "em": 0, "ex": 1, "error": null}
